post-it: Blue screen of death
cause: Failing hard drive
symptoms:
	Stops before Windows starts
	Error text at startup
	Restarts by itself
	Blue screen
	Slow computer
checks:
	yes: Bluescreen after the desktop appears
		shows: "A fatal exception 0E has occurred", then a reboot 6 s later
	no: Windows stays up after the desktop appears
hardware steps:
	Remove the computer shell
	Take out the hard drive, throw it in the trash
	Get a new hard drive from storage
	Install the hard drive
	Remount the shell
